== Verification coverage ==

The captures taken from this wiki cover reading, editing and administration: an article, this
main page and a search result; the wikitext edit form, a diff and a page history; preferences,
recent changes, a category page and a talk page; and several of the same surfaces again in dark
mode. Each capture is also scanned for accessibility violations and measured for contrast, and
consecutive runs are compared, so a change in the skin shows up as a change in the evidence.

== Content provenance ==

The four reference articles and their templates are imported from Wikipedia and remain available
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike licence. The article, the source URL and the
revision each export was taken from are recorded in the attribution notice that ships beside
this file. The imported articles are never edited: only this page, the talk page, the category
page and one seeded revision are authored locally.

